{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Ch7DA1h9r98fkPTqy3H9V","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"<final_document>\n**Subject: An apology about last season, and what we've changed**\n\nHi [Name],\n\nYou didn't renew your share this year, and I suspect last summer had something to do with it.\n\nOn July 9, a hailstorm destroyed about half our crops. For the next six weeks, your boxes had about half what they should have. We didn't offer refunds or credit, and I sent just one short email about it. You paid for a full share and didn't get one, and you deserved a clearer explanation than I gave you. I'm sorry.\n\nHere's what's different this year:\n\n- **A second field on higher ground**, so not all our crops are in one place.\n- **Two hail nets** over our tomatoes and peppers.\n- **Pause credit:** you can now pause up to two weeks and get credit for them.\n\nThose changes cost us $31,000, but a full share is still $540, the same as last year.\n\nSign-up closes March 15, and there are 52 shares left. We'd love to have you back on Thursdays.\n\n[Sign-up link]\n\nThank you,\n[Your name]\n[Farm name]\n</final_document>\n\nThe email is about 175 words. I didn't say the new field protects against hail, because you didn't tell me it does. I only said it spreads your crops across two places. If it was chosen for a specific reason, like better drainage or less exposure to storms, adding that in one short phrase would make the point stronger."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5354,"cache_read_input_tokens":3853,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":5354},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c9080433-08e9-4ba9-a1a8-e